---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { PRICING_VIDEO_FILTER } from '../data/heroGrading';
import { websitePlan, videoTiers, agentTiers } from '../data/pricing';
import { contactEmail } from '../data/site';

const lastUpdated = 'July 8, 2026';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service — Aex Meridian"
  description="The terms governing use of the Aex Meridian, LLC website and our web design, hosting, AI agent, and content services."
>
  <Header />
  <main id="main-content">
    <PageHero
      video="/videos/pricing-bg.mp4"
      videoId="terms-hero-loop"
      eyebrow="Legal"
      title="Terms of Service"
      subhead="The terms governing our work together — straightforward, in plain English."
      objectPosition="center 65%"
      videoFilter={PRICING_VIDEO_FILTER}
    />

    <section class="section legal-body">
      <div class="container legal-container">
        <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

        <h2>Overview</h2>
        <p>
          These Terms of Service ("Terms") govern your use of the Aex Meridian, LLC
          website and the website design and hosting, AI agent, and digital content
          services we offer (collectively, "Services"). By using this site or
          engaging our Services, you agree to these Terms.
        </p>

        <h2>Services description</h2>
        <p>
          Aex Meridian builds and maintains AI agents for small businesses — an AI
          voice receptionist with missed-call text-back, a website chat and
          lead-qualification agent, and a speed-to-lead follow-up agent — each
          configured for the client's own business. We also build custom websites
          and provide ongoing hosting and maintenance, and produce digital content,
          including listing walkthrough videos and social graphics, on request. All
          are separate service lines; specific scope, deliverables, and timelines
          for any engagement are agreed upon directly with each client before work
          begins.
        </p>

        <h2>Pricing and payment</h2>
        <p>
          Current pricing for a website engagement is a {websitePlan.setup} one-time
          setup fee due at launch, followed by a {websitePlan.monthly} care fee billed
          monthly thereafter. Each AI agent is a separate {agentTiers[0].setup} one-time
          setup fee, followed by a monthly fee that varies by agent type (full detail
          is published on our <a href="/pricing">Pricing</a> page). Digital content —
          walkthrough video, graphics, and social assets — is quoted per project, not
          billed as a retainer: walkthrough videos range from {videoTiers[0].price}&ndash;{videoTiers[2].price}
          depending on length and complexity, due upon delivery. A client may engage
          any of these service lines independently or together; none is ever bundled
          into another's monthly fee. Pricing is subject to change for future
          engagements; any change will be communicated before it applies to an
          existing client relationship.
        </p>

        <h2>AI agent services</h2>
        <p>
          Every AI agent Aex Meridian builds is scoped to the specific business it
          serves, discloses that it is an automated system at the start of every
          conversation, and includes a path to escalate to a human for anything
          outside its scope. An agent assists — it does not guarantee an outcome,
          and it may occasionally provide an inaccurate or incomplete response
          despite reasonable configuration and testing. Aex Meridian does not
          guarantee a specific increase in calls answered, leads recovered, or
          revenue from any agent.
        </p>
        <p>
          Aex Meridian does not build or operate agents that place outbound calls or
          send outbound text messages to a client's customers or contacts. Any
          contact data a client provides for use in an agent workflow (for example, a
          customer list used for appointment reminders) must have appropriate
          consent already in place; the client warrants this is the case and agrees
          to indemnify Aex Meridian against any claim arising from contacts the
          client supplied.
        </p>

        <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
        <p>
          Upon full payment of the setup fee, ownership of the custom website design
          and content created specifically for your business transfers to you. Aex
          Meridian retains the right to display completed work in its own portfolio
          and marketing materials unless otherwise agreed in writing.
        </p>

        <h2>Cancellation</h2>
        <p>
          Monthly hosting and maintenance, and any monthly agent service, may each be
          canceled at any time with 30 days' written notice to <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a>. One-time
          engagements, such as an individual video project or a digital content batch,
          are billed upon delivery and are not subject to a cancellation notice period
          once completed.
        </p>

        <h2>No warranty</h2>
        <p>
          Services are provided "as is." While we make every effort to deliver a
          reliable, professional website and polished video and content deliverables,
          Aex Meridian does not guarantee uninterrupted uptime, specific business
          outcomes, engagement, bookings, or search engine or social media rankings
          resulting from our work.
        </p>

        <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p>
          To the maximum extent permitted by law, Aex Meridian, LLC is not liable for
          any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from your use of
          this site or our Services.
        </p>

        <h2>Governing law</h2>
        <p>
          These Terms are governed by the laws of the State of Colorado, without
          regard to its conflict-of-law principles, as that is where Aex Meridian,
          LLC is formed. This applies to disputes over the contract itself and does
          not limit who our Services are available to.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes to these Terms</h2>
        <p>
          We may update these Terms from time to time. Continued use of our Services
          after a change constitutes acceptance of the revised Terms.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about these Terms can be sent to <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-body {
    background: var(--color-white);
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .legal-container {
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .legal-updated {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .legal-container :global(h2) {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    margin-top: var(--space-5);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .legal-container :global(h2:first-of-type) {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .legal-container :global(p) {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
  }

  .legal-container :global(a) {
    /* .legal-body is --color-white — plain --color-steel is ~3.7:1 there and
       fails AA for this body-text link size; on-light variant matches the
       rest of the site's light-background convention. */
    color: var(--color-steel-on-light);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
